approval was needed because v2.3.0 has a healthy production record.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The first incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created. I did not open a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the current state.\n\nFollow-ups for the team:\n- Investigate why v2.3.1 failed health checks before anyone redeploys it.\n- Investigate the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt.", "type": "text"}]}]}